    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54953" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπύκν-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>condensation</i> (v. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπυκνόω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἡδομένου</span>
			<i>densification, solidification</i> of pleasure by filling in
			unoccupied gaps in time and completing the penetration of the
			organism, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				432
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				354
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in Music,
				<i>close packing</i> of the intervals in a scale, <i><span class="en">
				Aristox.
				<u>Harm.</u>
				p.7
			</span></i> M., <i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Harm.</u>
				11
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
